Data Scientist (Electromagnetic Environment) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;isPasted&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metrea delivers effects-as-a-service to national security partners across five domains and more than a dozen mission areas. These include airborne ISR, electronic warfare, secure communications, aerial refueling, special air missions, aerial firefighting, and advanced simulation. We own the whole stack: designing, building, and operating turnkey capabilities that give our partners decisive, asymmetric advantage against rapidly evolving threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our operating model is built around three interlocking pillars. The Support Groups provide a global shared-service – spanning people, finance, platform, operations, legal, and engagement. This frees up our Core Groups, who develop and own mission capabilities end-to-end, to focus entirely on delivery. The Market Groups apply a regional lens, ensuring that our agile and adaptable capabilities remain aligned to the wicked problems that matter most to our partners across the Americas, EMEA, and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of our model is a simple but powerful idea: be a true partner with skin in the game. Our partners need effects, not just equipment. By owning the full stack – from the lab to the field – we are able to drive a continuous cycle of innovation that keeps our partners ahead. It&#39;s a fast-moving, intellectually demanding environment where talented people are given real responsibility, work on problems that matter, and contribute to an enterprise that is growing quickly and deliberately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Washington, DC, with facilities across the United States, the United Kingdom, as well as Continental Europe and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Group Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Digital and Synthetic Capability Unit (D&amp;amp;S) is committed to providing mission-driven information solutions that seamlessly bridge the digital and physical realms. Leveraging cutting-edge technologies and advanced platforms, we empower operational readiness and elevate situational awareness across diverse domains—including air, maritime, and space. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will apply machine learning, data science, and advanced analytical techniques to complex challenges across the electromagnetic environment. Working within Metrea’s Decision Science Laboratory (DESLAB) and automated Solution Engine, you will design, test, and deploy ML-enabled capabilities that go beyond traditional signal processing approaches. This includes exploring the potential of methods such as Transformers, self-supervised learning, probabilistic modelling and simulation-driven learning approaches for electromagnetic sensing and exploitation. You will be successful if you are comfortable moving between research, experimentation, and operational delivery, turning ambiguous Defence and Aerospace problems into robust technical solutions that can be tested, explained, and deployed in real-world settings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Translate operational requirements into technical solutions, working closely with cross-functional teams across&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;decision&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;science,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;electromagnetic simulation, waveform design,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;engineering, operations, hardware, and aerial systems&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Apply machine learning, data science, and RF-aware analytical techniques to electromagnetic, problem sets, including spectrum classification, emitter detection, anomaly&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;detection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;signal characterisation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Explore and develop modern approaches for electromagnetic sensing and exploitation, including convolutional neural networks, transformers, autoencoders, graph-based&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;methods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; or probabilistic approaches for uncertainty-aware decision-making&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Design and conduct experiments to assess new algorithms&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; techniques&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Develop proof-of-concept capabilities and support the deployment of selected approaches into operational environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Liaise with forward-deployed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;teammates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; to understand real-world constraints, user needs, data limitations, environmental effects, and deployment considerations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Build reliable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;analytical workflows using appropriate&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;MLOps&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;, and cloud-based practices, including version control, experiment tracking, automated testing, model monitoring, and scalable compute infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Communicate complex technical concepts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;for no-technical users&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;clearly through reports, demonstrations, briefings, and workshops&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Mentor junior team members and help foster a collaborative, innovative, and technically rigorous environment, while staying current with emerging developments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A post-doctoral degree in a quantitative field such as Physics, Engineering, Mathematics, Computer Science, Statistics, or a related STEM discipline, or equivalent professional experience supported by a Master’s degree&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with modern approaches such as CNNs, Transformers, autoencoders, self-supervised learning, probabilistic modelling, or simulation-driven learning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming capability in Python, including experience with scientific computing, machine learning frameworks, and data analysis libraries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying data science, machine learning, or advanced analytics to electromagnetic or related operational problem sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to design rigorous experiments, evaluate model and algorithm performance, and translate findings into clear technical recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, with the ability to explain complex ML, RF, statistical, and engineering concepts to technical and non-technical audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset, strong technical curiosity, and the ability to work effectively in a fast-paced, mission-focused environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional&amp;nbsp;Eligibility&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible to hold UK SC-level security clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Right to live and work in the UK&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsided gym membership / plans through Wellhub   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Electric Car scheme   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to work scheme     &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch on office days  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced Parental Leave  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30 days annual PTO plus b/h &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bonus Scheme &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal development opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work&amp;nbsp;Authorization&amp;nbsp;/&amp;nbsp;Security&amp;nbsp;Clearance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The employee will have the legal right to work in the UK and will be able to produce right to work documentation. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AAP/EEO Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metrea is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Employment decisions are made without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, disability, or other characteristics protected by law. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position&amp;nbsp;Type&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Expected&amp;nbsp;Hours&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time non-exempt position with typical working hours of Monday through Friday, 9:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. Hours and work shifts may change in accordance with department and business needs. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work&amp;nbsp;Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This job operates in an office setting with hybrid working.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Occasional travel to other UK, Stockholm and US offices; predominantly in the UK.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Firmware&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Metrea, our single core value is Rooted in Humility, and our four cornerstone attributes are Entrepreneurial, Systematic, Discerning, and Over-Deliver. These form what we call our Teammate Firmware. Just like technical firmware connects software and hardware, our Firmware is the constant interface between our mission and our people. It defines how we show up, how we work together, and how we solve complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team Firmware creates a web-like, hyper-collaborative, dynamically hierarchical way of working that helps us adapt quickly, communicate openly, and distribute decision-making to where expertise actually lives. It enables groups to self-organize around hard problems, shift fluidly as priorities evolve, and operate with the trust, curiosity, and discipline required in a complex mission space. This foundation allows us to deliver elegant, effective solutions and uphold our purpose: protecting our precious inheritance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Decision Science Lab  London

Staff Engineer (Global Billing, Payments & API) &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Job title: Staff Engineer (Global Billing, Payments &amp;amp; API)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: London / Bristol / Edinburgh (Hybrid Office - 3+ days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £97,000 - £122,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: Global Billing, Payments &amp;amp; API&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level: TL2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London, Bristol or Edinburgh and requires existing right to work in the UK.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1209&quot; data-local-id=&quot;be6b48ec2d51&quot;&gt;Kaluza runs the billing and payments engine behind some of the world&#39;s biggest energy retailers. This role builds and evolves the platform other engineering teams build on top of: the shared APIs, integration patterns, and technical standards that let billing and payments capability get built once and reused everywhere, instead of rebuilt separately for every new market or client relationship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1607&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d24c52acbb8&quot;&gt;That matters because of where Kaluza is headed: as we grow into new markets and take on more of the world&#39;s largest energy retailers as clients, having a consistent, well-designed API platform is what lets new capability get adopted quickly and safely across every team that needs it, rather than each team solving integration and standards problems on its own. Getting this right directly shapes how fast Kaluza can extend billing and payments capability to new markets and clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2092&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d35eaa611228&quot;&gt;We&#39;re also in the middle of reorganising how this part of the business works, moving toward one shared global core that every market configures rather than rebuilds. This role&#39;s remit, API platform and standards, is one of the technical foundations that shift depends on.&amp;nbsp;Responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2390&quot; data-local-id=&quot;22415c66caef&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll own system design and architecture for the API Platform and Standards squad, not just a single service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2504&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5a0efd0d3267&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll create and challenge product and engineering proposals, backing design trade-offs with data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2607&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1fece0136afa&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll diagnose and resolve complex technical and product issues, including in areas outside your immediate domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2726&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c0e823074866&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll establish architectural patterns and technical standards that other teams build on top of.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2827&quot; data-local-id=&quot;df104ccadc3a&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll take ambiguous, loosely-defined technical requirements and turn them into a concrete plan others can execute against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2955&quot; data-local-id=&quot;65a053302e4e&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll influence engineering leadership, product, and adjacent squads to bring clarity and alignment on technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3083&quot; data-local-id=&quot;70fead046819&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll mentor and upskill engineers beyond your immediate team, contributing to a wider learning culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3221&quot; data-local-id=&quot;346c3b7b7539&quot;&gt;Have deep technical expertise applied to system design and architecture ownership across a squad, not just a single team or service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3357&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f9fd785b722a&quot;&gt;Be able to create and challenge product and engineering proposals and make design trade-offs, backed by data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3470&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8eb22f9f0034&quot;&gt;Have a track record diagnosing and resolving complex technical and product issues, including in domains you aren&#39;t already close to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3606&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5ef8bcbdef02&quot;&gt;Be skilled at establishing and driving adoption of architectural patterns and technical standards that other teams build on top of.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3741&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c56bb58af80f&quot;&gt;Be comfortable taking ambiguous, loosely-defined technical requirements and turning them into a concrete plan others can execute against.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3882&quot; data-local-id=&quot;174d43dde741&quot;&gt;Be accomplished at influencing both upwards and outwards, bringing clarity and alignment to engineering leadership, product, and adjacent squads on technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4054&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4c409eee405d&quot;&gt;Have a track record mentoring and upskilling other engineers, and fostering a learning culture beyond your own immediate team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4184&quot; data-local-id=&quot;13c0cb42afe6&quot;&gt;Be comfortable operating in a high-integrity data domain (billing or payments), where reliability, security, and auditability come before speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4332&quot; data-local-id=&quot;b38cb99cb9f3&quot;&gt;Have demonstrable customer obsession and a working-backwards practice: start from the problem other engineering teams or end customers have, and design the simplest platform capability that solves it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4536&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e0e10c5bfda0&quot;&gt;Have a demonstrable record of applying AI/LLMs to deliver customer impact, not just adopting AI tooling internally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4721&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3bdb821c08f5&quot;&gt;Direct experience with API gateway, versioning, or developer-experience standards work at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4821&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c37617e49e91&quot;&gt;Direct experience in billing, payments, or financial-services domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4895&quot; data-local-id=&quot;e34a57292521&quot;&gt;Experience operating a &quot;global core, configurable edge&quot; or multi-market platform model (one engine, configuration at the edge, no client-specific forks of core logic).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business: Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;br&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more about working in&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot;&gt; Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Bristol; Edinburgh; London

Product Manager - Energy Billing (Fluent French & English) &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job title:&lt;/strong&gt; Product Manager (Billing)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; London — 3 days in office (occasional travel to Paris required)&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team:&lt;/strong&gt; Product Management - Billing &amp;amp; Payments&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Head of Product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in London, UK and requires the successful candidate to be based in or willing to relocate to London. Fluent French and English (spoken and written) are essential for this position.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please submit your profile in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today&#39;s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future. Leveraging Data, AI, and real-time decision-making we turn energy complexity into growth opportunities for our partners.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable and affordable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the localisation efforts for our global energy billing platform, ensuring it meets the specific regulatory, market, and cultural requirements of France, from meter read to bill.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll be in charge of the French localisation of the Billing Module—one of the core product domains at the heart of the Kaluza platform. The Billing module processes consumption, pricing, and account data to schedule, calculate, and generate accurate, timely, and compliant invoices throughout a customer’s lifecycle. The module automatically manages billing cycles, generates bills, handles corrections, and produces the data that feeds invoices, billing-related communications, payment schedules, and downstream financial reporting, while powering customer and agent UIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on, full-stack product role — you&#39;ll work across the whole domain and alongside PMs from other domains and from the global billing teams to ensure the overall billing&amp;nbsp; journey from meter to bill meets the requirements of French clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate intensely with clients and in-country experts&lt;/strong&gt; to understand their unique needs and requirements, negotiate scope, and build a roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep dive into French energy market regulations&lt;/strong&gt;, translating complex compliance needs into detailed product specifications for the billing system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and manage detailed product requirements &lt;/strong&gt;for features related to country-specific needs from getting a read to generating a bill (meter reading protocols, invoice formats, taxation rules, payment methods, and regulatory reporting).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work closely with engineering, UX, and QA teams &lt;/strong&gt;to ensure the successful implementation and testing of localised billing functionalities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Act as the go-to expert &lt;/strong&gt;for global teams on specific French market nuances related to energy billing and customer journeys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Continuously monitor changes in French energy legislation&lt;/strong&gt; and market practices, proactively adapting the product roadmap to maintain compliance and competitiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you&#39;ll have/be:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven experience as a Product Manager, or equivalent role in software companies&lt;/strong&gt;, with a strong track record of successfully localising complex software products for international markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid understanding of the end-to-end B2C billing lifecycle&lt;/strong&gt; including meter data, tariffs, invoicing, and debt management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record in regulated markets where billing complexity matters, &lt;/strong&gt;energy, telecoms, financial services, or similar. Familiarity with the French energy market (ENGIE, CRE, switching, tariff structures) is advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional ability to translate abstract regulatory text or client requirements into clear, actionable, outcome-driven requirements for development teams.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience collaborating with cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt; (engineering, design, legal, operations, client success) to deliver localised solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excellent stakeholder and client management skills&lt;/strong&gt;, able to lead conversations across requirements, scope, expectations, and roadmap alignment, and communicate technical &amp;amp; market complexity clearly to varied audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proficiency in AI tools throughout all stages of the product lifecycle — from discovery and ideation to delivery and iteration.Fluent in French and English&lt;/strong&gt; — our platform and many of our teams operate in English, so you move easily between both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A builder&#39;s mindset&lt;/strong&gt; — you&#39;re autonomous, learn fast, and aren&#39;t afraid to go deep. You&#39;re comfortable interrogating a codebase with AI tools, reading an API schema or data model, and writing a SQL query to get the answer you need.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and pace&lt;/strong&gt; — you can operate effectively when not everything is defined, know when to make a call, and aren&#39;t afraid to escalate or ask for help when it matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent in French and very comfortable in English&lt;/strong&gt; — our platform and many of our teams operate in English, so you move easily between both&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
