&lt;li&gt;Location: London / Bristol / Edinburgh (Hybrid Office - 3+ days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: Enterprise Architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level: TL2 / TL3&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London, Bristol or Edinburgh&amp;nbsp;and requires existing right to work in the UK.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;303&quot; data-local-id=&quot;71635837-a0ff-40e4-8b75-a1ff2b4444d0&quot;&gt;As a Principal Software Engineer at Kaluza, you will be the leading technical authority for a major global product area comprising multiple modules. You will lead innovation on some of the most complex, ambiguous, and large-scale solutions, aligning them with target architecture standards and contributing to the creation of a scalable platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;651&quot; data-local-id=&quot;afe318c5-d169-4335-980d-c55899c830d5&quot;&gt;You’ll have a broad sphere of influence, enabling multiple teams and serving as a strategic partner to our architecture leadership team and our community of principal and staff engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;840&quot; data-local-id=&quot;5d1958d8-2004-4ea0-821c-a0ebcadb4a0e&quot;&gt;Your impact will come mostly from &#39;hands-off&#39; work; you’ll not be expected to write code day-to-day. But for some challenges, you may need to dive into code-level design or help build a proof-of-concept.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1072&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c232f15f-f0a4-4008-a7b5-f91f1cfafc20&quot;&gt;Architect modern distributed, cloud-based systems applying modern architecture and engineering practices in an enterprise software environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1219&quot; data-local-id=&quot;8dba6a70-6d5c-45e2-a3af-1ccdaa41a861&quot;&gt;Shape and influence technical vision and product roadmaps to align with business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1310&quot; data-local-id=&quot;562ddf14-2519-461d-9844-e47621078721&quot;&gt;Provide hands-on leadership, making appropriate technical choices to satisfy requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7a0244ae-b45c-4845-88d4-50316da986b9&quot;&gt;Mentor and guide engineers in delivering autonomous, loosely coupled distributed systems with proven architectural principles and patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1547&quot; data-local-id=&quot;77346099-2aa3-43c1-91d9-749290fea5e1&quot;&gt;Lead technical due diligence and make high-stakes decisions with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1627&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7e1a1e9f-a262-4aec-8e83-9332f726304a&quot;&gt;Deliver results, influence diverse audiences, and orchestrate cross-functional solutions spanning multiple product features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1755&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c409df9a-e0b3-4f6b-a9a3-39d995612adf&quot;&gt;Engage effectively with both technical teams and executive leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1826&quot; data-local-id=&quot;7cb74d57-f395-456f-b7cf-298b271ed930&quot;&gt;Work independently and collaboratively, bringing strong opinions while respecting others, communicating openly, and maintaining self-awareness with a continuous growth mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2035&quot; data-local-id=&quot;a0dbc1d1-8544-470c-ae8a-18a2b9c5f141&quot;&gt;Experience enabling engineering teams to use AI and delivering AI/ML powered solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2126&quot; data-local-id=&quot;4e471dc5-7261-4e8c-ad4b-265e11f79d54&quot;&gt;Demonstrable experience in architecting solutions in complex business domains, particularly interface design and data modelling, ideally with experience in AWS and API design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2305&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1d87f974-8329-4a1b-9b26-2dfa45af34f8&quot;&gt;Proven track record delivering global &lt;span data-highlighted=&quot;true&quot; data-vc=&quot;highlighted-text&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_1mT5xdRAKS&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_0nmozVaHVx _2V7sgO2M4S _3BoeIDwZ7G _30zrXRyxdf _0ReiIH7zJH&quot; data-testid=&quot;definition-highlighter&quot;&gt;B2B2C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; SaaS (energy or other mission‑critical industries).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2404&quot; data-local-id=&quot;769f5e5e-483c-4ef8-ba0e-ff433059a8a0&quot;&gt;Success driving adoption of modern engineering practices (e.g. DevOps, CI/CD).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2486&quot; data-local-id=&quot;d6312d22-3a41-4bcc-837e-9eee49ca8fda&quot;&gt;Experience leading teams through significant changes in ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2562&quot; data-local-id=&quot;f6f5546f-363b-4985-91fd-d58666e49784&quot;&gt;Ability to ramp up rapidly in new domains and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business: Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;br&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more about working in&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot;&gt; Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Engineering  Bristol; Edinburgh; London

Head of Product (Flex) &lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Job title: Head of Product (Flex)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: London (Hybrid Office - 3+ days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: £112,000 - £140,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: Product (Flex)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Level: HoD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in London and requires existing right to work in the UK.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At this time, we are not able to offer visa sponsorship for this role. We are committed to building a diverse, global team and our sponsorship policy is evaluated on a role-by-role basis. We encourage you to keep an eye on our careers site to stay informed about future opportunities where we are able to offer visa sponsorship.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kaluza.com/&quot;&gt;Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With teams across Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Head of Product for Flex, you own the vision, strategy and commercial success of our residential VPP platform globally. You lead a product organisation of Product Managers embedded across our device integration, optimisation, monetisation and SaaS platform teams, and you sit on the Flex Leadership team alongside our Head of Engineering, jointly accountable for the performance of the whole Flex business. Specifically, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and own the global product strategy for Flex, translating Kaluza&#39;s company-level strategy into a roadmap spanning device integrations, multi-asset optimisation (EV, battery, solar, HEMS), monetisation and market access, and self-serve SaaS capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a high-performing product organisation - hiring, developing and retaining Product Managers of all levels, and identifying and growing the next generation of product leaders within Flex.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make the trade-off calls that matter: balance the needs of our two core client segments - energy retailers and device OEMs - defaulting to retailer priorities where they conflict, in line with Flex&#39;s strategy, while protecting the long-term health of the platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Head of Engineering and our Commercial and Partnerships teams to align product, technical and commercial strategy, and to make resourcing and investment decisions across Flex&#39;s product and engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define annual goals and OKRs for Flex, aligned to Kaluza&#39;s company strategy, and hold your organisation accountable for delivering measurable commercial and platform-quality outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the client-facing expert for Flex product: lead demos and pitches for prospective retailer and OEM clients, contribute to proposals and pricing, and represent Flex&#39;s product practice at Kaluza-wide and industry forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the long-term roadmap narrative - kept current, accessible, and able to be told confidently to prospects and clients two years out - as well as internally to engineering, design, partnerships and commercial teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain your network with Product, Partnership, Engineering and Commercial leaders across Kaluza, ensuring insight from Flex feeds into - and benefits from - the wider Kaluza product strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion product craft and ways of working across Flex, raising the bar for discovery, prioritisation and measurable impact, in a fast-moving, resource-constrained environment where judgement on trade-offs matters as much as vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a proven, experienced product leader with a track record of building, leading and developing product teams and people managers, not just individual contributors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a seasoned expert in product strategy and execution across the full product lifecycle, with a track record of translating ambiguous, complex problems into a clear strategy and roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong commercial instincts - comfortable owning pricing input, business cases and ROI, and able to demonstrate commercial impact and business growth through your teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be an excellent communicator, able to present complex, ambiguous problems clearly and persuasively to technical and non-technical audiences, from engineers to clients to Kaluza&#39;s leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have deep experience with, or a genuine ability to quickly get up to speed in, complex multi-sided B2B / B2B2C technology platforms - direct experience in energy, DER orchestration, IoT device platforms or smart devices is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be comfortable operating with high ambiguity, making the call yourself where appropriate and knowing when to escalate, in a fast-paced and frequently changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a track record of fostering a strong product culture and coaching others - including peers without being their formal manager - to raise the standard of product work around them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be data-driven in how you measure impact, and able to hold yourself and your teams accountable to outcomes, not just outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What will set you apart&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in energy trading, national and regional flexibility markets, or other VPP monetisation opportunity spaces (e.g. balancing markets, capacity markets, wholesale/imbalance trading, ancillary services).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience with VPPs, EV/battery smart charging, HEMS, or residential demand-flexibility products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UK and/or international energy market mechanics (e.g. BSC, NEM, market settlement, DER integration standards).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling or supporting the sale of platform/SaaS propositions to enterprise clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Kaluza Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Here at Kaluza we have five core values that guide us as a business: Play to win, Solve the real problem, Build trust every day, Own the outcome, Go further together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary Bonus Scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance + Virtual GP&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to Furthr - a Climate Action app&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free Mortgage Advice and Eye Tests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perks at Work - access to thousands of retail discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5% Flex Fund - to spend on the benefits you want most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;26 days holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Progressive Leave Policy - With no qualifying service periods, including 26 weeks full pay if you have a new addition to your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Personal Learning Budget - Upskill, learn and grow!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home Office Budget&lt;br&gt;And more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We want the best people&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re keen to meet people from all walks of life — our view is that the more inclusive we are, the better our work will be. We want to build teams which represent a variety of experiences, perspectives and skills, and we recognise talent on the basis of merit and potential.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We understand some people may not apply for jobs unless they tick every box. But if you&#39;re excited about joining us and think you have some of what we&#39;re looking for, even if you&#39;re not 100% sure, we&#39;d still love to hear from you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Find out more about working in&lt;a href=&quot;http://kaluza.com/&quot;&gt; Kaluza&lt;/a&gt; on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://kaluza-dev.webflow.io/careers&quot;&gt; careers page&lt;/a&gt; and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/kaluza/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Product  London

Staff Software Engineer, Non-Realtime Controllers &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About IonQ:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2F&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=IonQ%2C+Inc&amp;amp;index=7&amp;amp;md5=0818ffbedc6dbad8c4d1611ac94c2a0f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;IonQ, Inc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;. [NYSE: IONQ] is the world’s leading quantum platform and merchant supplier - delivering integrated quantum solutions across computing, networking, sensing, and security. IonQ’s newest generation of quantum computers, the IonQ Tempo, is the latest in a line of cutting-edge systems that have been helping customers and partners including &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=Amazon+Web+Services%2C&amp;amp;index=8&amp;amp;md5=a7f94ee9b71a392dca3cd6c413722e51&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Amazon Web Services, &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=and&amp;amp;index=9&amp;amp;md5=2bed627b388878763f41ffe0e4edb16c&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;and &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-speeds-quantum-accelerated-drug-development-application-with&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=AstraZeneca&amp;amp;index=10&amp;amp;md5=757c1f2c2ec94cf3982700106122164f&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AstraZeneca&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt; achieve 20x performance results and accelerate innovation in drug discovery, materials science, financial modeling, logistics, cybersecurity, and defense. In 2025, the company achieved 99.99% two-qubit gate fidelity, &lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fionq.com%2Fnews%2Fionq-achieves-landmark-result-setting-new-world-record-in-quantum-computing&amp;amp;esheet=54451094&amp;amp;newsitemid=20260316477473&amp;amp;lan=en-US&amp;amp;anchor=setting+a+world+record+in+quantum+computing+performance&amp;amp;index=11&amp;amp;md5=32e9cb88afbd439026a352666cc72c91&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;setting a world record in quantum computing performance&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headquartered in College Park, Maryland, IonQ has operations in California, Colorado, Massachusetts, Tennessee, Washington, Italy, South Korea, Sweden, Switzerland, Canada, and the United Kingdom. Our quantum computing services are available through all major cloud providers, while we also meet the needs of networking and sensing customers across land, sea, air, and space. IonQ is making quantum platforms more accessible and impactful than ever before. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Oxford, UK&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office commitment:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quantum is now, and it&#39;s built here. Oxford Ionics, now part of IonQ, is pioneering the next generation of quantum computing. Using our world-leading trapped-ion technology, we&#39;re building the most powerful, accurate and reliable quantum systems to tackle problems that today&#39;s supercomputers cannot solve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an enthusiastic and highly technical Staff Software Engineer for our non-realtime controllers team who will thrive in our dynamic cross-disciplinary environment. You&#39;d be working closely with our skilled software engineers, our systems teams who operate the physical quantum computers, and our world-leading quantum scientists to build and operate the software that controls the hardware surrounding our quantum computers. Previous exposure to quantum systems is not required.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will take on our most demanding hardware integrations and the framework work that makes every other controller better. This is a hands-on engineering role: you would be the most experienced engineer writing controllers, not the one directing others to write them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A working quantum computer is far more than the ion trap and its real-time control electronics. It depends on a fleet of supporting hardware, including cryogenic compressors, vacuum pumps, power supplies, lasers, temperature controllers, wavemeters and cameras, that has to be kept observable, controllable and reliable. The timing-critical operations such as gate waveforms and ion transport run on dedicated real-time FPGA systems, while this team owns everything that does not need hard timing guarantees. These services run on general-purpose Linux hardware and must be rock-solid, because a failed compressor or an un-noticed pressure drift takes a whole machine offline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering role. Your influence comes from the code you ship and review, and from the problems you take off everyone else&#39;s plate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on our most demanding device integrations, and do the deep diagnosis of problems that only appear against real hardware in a live lab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remove whole classes of failure across the fleet, rather than instances of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the shared framework yourself, and bring the existing controllers along with each change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the tooling, simulators and test infrastructure that let the whole team move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve how our services are deployed and operated as the fleet grows, and make the fleet observable enough that problems are found early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the bar of everyone around you through the code you write and the reviews you give.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To be successful, you will need deep systems engineering experience, a track record of shipping and operating reliable services, and the judgement to tell a problem worth solving structurally from one worth patching. We&#39;re looking for someone who wants to stay hands-on in the code at this level rather than move away from it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’d be a great fit with:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert systems engineering skills. Our controllers are written in Rust, so either solid Rust experience or deep proficiency in another systems language and the appetite to work in a Rust codebase, including async programming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating networked services in production such as gRPC or REST, with a real grasp of error handling, observability and failure modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of hardware and instrument protocols and interfaces such as SCPI, Modbus, serial and Ethernet.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation as the person people bring the undiagnosable bug to, and the ability to prioritise work with a clear understanding of critical versus urgent items.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills both within software and across disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be part of a team that’s shaping the future of quantum. We offer more than just a role, you’ll join a world class community of scientists, engineers and innovators working to unlock the full potential of quantum computing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a range of benefits, including opportunities to further your career alongside industry leaders, a competitive salary with IonQ stock options, an annual performance bonus, generous annual leave, flexible hybrid working, private medical and dental insurance for you and your family, and much more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the future of quantum computing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be an equal opportunity employer and welcome applicants from all backgrounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Compensation will vary based on individual factors such as education, qualifications, and experience of the final candidate(s), specific office location, and calibration against relevant market data and internal team equity. Posted base salary figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. Our benefits include comprehensive medical, dental, and vision plans, matching 401(k), unlimited PTO and paid holidays, parental/adoption leave, legal insurance, and a home technology stipend. Details of participation in these benefit plans will be provided when a candidate receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At IonQ, we believe in fair treatment, access, opportunity, and advancement for all while striving to identify and eliminate barriers. We empower employees to thrive by fostering a culture of autonomy, productivity, and respect. We are dedicated to creating an environment where individuals can feel welcomed, respected, supported, and valued.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We are committed to equity and justice. We welcome different voices and viewpoints and do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, ancestry, physical and/or mental disability, medical condition, genetic information, marital status, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, age, sexual orientation, military or veteran status, or any other basis protected by law. We are proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;The position you are applying for will require access to technology that is subject to U.S. export control and government contract restrictions.&amp;nbsp; Employment with IonQ is contingent on either verifying “U.S. Person” (e.g., U.S. citizen, U.S. national, U.S. permanent resident, or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum) status for export controls and government contracts work, obtaining any necessary license, and/or confirming the availability of a license exception under U.S. export controls.&amp;nbsp; Please note that in the absence of confirming you are a U.S. Person for export control and government contracts work purposes, IonQ may choose not to apply for a license or decline to use a license exception (if available) for you to access export-controlled technology that may require authorization, and similarly, you may not qualify for government contracts work that requires U.S. Persons, and IonQ may decline to proceed with your application on those bases alone.&amp;nbsp; Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;US Non-Technical Jobs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Due to applicable export control laws and regulations, candidates must be a U.S. citizen or national, U.S. permanent resident (i.e., current Green Card holder), or lawfully admitted into the U.S. as a refugee or granted asylum. Accordingly, we will have some additional questions regarding your immigration status that will be used for export control and compliance purposes, and the answers will be reviewed by compliance personnel to ensure compliance with federal law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are interested in being a part of our team and mission, we encourage you to apply!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Compute - Engineering  Oxford

AI engineer (AI & GenAI) - People Domain (f/m/d) &lt;h3&gt;Dans le cadre de l’ouverture d’un poste en CDI, nous recrutons un.e &lt;strong&gt;AI engineer (f/m/d)&lt;/strong&gt;, basé-e à Paris.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 CONTEXTE &amp;amp; ENJEUX STRATÉGIQUES&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de Decathlon Digital, l&#39;équipe People Data engage une initiative majeure : transformer l&#39;expérience de nos 100 000 collaborateurs par l&#39;intégration de l&#39;IA Générative et Agentique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Face à la fragmentation de l&#39;écosystème RH dans plus de 70 pays, notre ambition est de construire une couche de simplification en s’appuyant sur les nouvelles solutions que proposent l’IA. Il s&#39;agit d&#39;une couche d&#39;intelligence centralisée et agnostique des outils, capable d&#39;interagir avec l&#39;ensemble de notre infrastructure (Workday, Data Lake, University, ...) pour faire évoluer nos interfaces d&#39;une logique de consultation vers une logique d&#39;action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans ce cadre, nous développons &lt;strong&gt;DaiLY&lt;/strong&gt;, notre agent conversationnel RH. Il aide nos collaborateurs et managers à accéder instantanément à une information fiable, sourcée à partir de notre documentation Workday et de nos politiques People.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Déjà déployé avec succès en France, DaiLY entre dans une nouvelle phase de passage à l&#39;échelle : extension internationale, industrialisation des évaluations, amélioration continue de nos modèles et de leurs qualités et déploiement et intégration d’agents autonomes RH.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour mener ce projet, nous ne recherchons pas uniquement un.e développeur.se, nous avons besoin d&#39;un.e &quot;&lt;strong&gt;Builder&lt;/strong&gt;&quot; : un.e personne capable de traduire un besoin métier en solution technique, de l’implémenter, la qualifier, la déployer et la maintenir dans le temps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;🎯 VOTRE MISSION&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un(e) &lt;strong&gt;AI Engineer confirmé(e)&lt;/strong&gt; pour participer activement à l&#39;industrialisation et au développement de DaiLY. Votre objectif est clair : transformer les besoins métiers RH en fonctionnalités IA fiables, mesurables et robustes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pour relever ce défi, vous évoluerez au &lt;strong&gt;sein d&#39;un collectif dédié&lt;/strong&gt;, en collaboration directe avec d&#39;autres AI Engineers, un Lead AI Engineer (qui orientera les choix d&#39;architecture globale) et une Product Manager. Cette organisation de proximité vous permettra d&#39;assurer une synergie parfaite entre les enjeux produits, la roadmap et l&#39;implémentation technique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous aurez notamment un rôle clé dans l&#39;évolution de DaiLY : passer d&#39;un modèle de simple consultation (Q&amp;amp;A) à un &lt;strong&gt;véritable système agentique transactionnel&lt;/strong&gt; capable de déclencher des actions concrètes (ex : poser des congés dans Workday, s&#39;inscrire à des formations via Decathlon University).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🛠 VOS RESPONSABILITES&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développement Agentique &amp;amp; Fonctionnalités&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participer à l&#39;extension des capacités de DaiLY vers des actions d&#39;écriture (write actions) en implémentant des protocoles de tool-calling (MCP - Model Context Protocol) et des communications inter-agents (A2A).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implémenter des stratégies avancées de chunking et de re-ranking pour prioriser les règles spécifiques au domaine RH.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l&#39;optimisation des coûts, de la latence et de l&#39;efficacité globale du système en lien avec les équipes Plateforme et Infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualité, Évaluation &amp;amp; Observabilité (LLMOps)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer et maintenir la couche de qualité du pipeline RAG multi-agents (Vertex AI Search / Discovery Engine).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assurer le grounding (ancrage) des réponses et la vérification des citations pour garantir la traçabilité vers une source de vérité.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en place des pipelines d&#39;observabilité robustes pour l&#39;évaluation online et offline (OpenTelemetry, MLflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coder des évaluateurs automatiques basés sur des golden datasets pour itérer sereinement et prévenir les régressions avant chaque mise en production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Intégrer des garde-fous (guardrails) pour protéger le système et les utilisateurs contre les hallucinations et les erreurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sécurité, Cloisonnement &amp;amp; Déploiement International&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access Management (ACLs) : Implémenter une gestion granulaire et dynamique des droits d&#39;accès au niveau de l&#39;indexation et du retrieval, garantissant qu&#39;un collaborateur n&#39;accède strictement qu&#39;aux documents RH de son périmètre.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Isolation &amp;amp; Multi-tenancy : Mettre en œuvre des stratégies de filtrage par métadonnées (metadata filtering) en base vectorielle et de cloisonnement (des index et/ou des modèles) pour assurer une étanchéité parfaite des données entre les différentes sociétés fiscales, entités légales et géographies de Decathlon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Multilingue : Contribuer à l&#39;architecture d&#39;internationalisation de DaiLY en adaptant les pipelines RAG, l&#39;embedding et l&#39;inférence pour maintenir un haut niveau de performance et de pertinence sur une grande diversité de langues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produit &amp;amp; Impact Business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aider à l&#39;analyse des intentions des utilisateurs pour mesurer l&#39;impact de DaiLY.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Traduire, avec l&#39;appui de la Product Manager et du Lead, les enjeux métier en comportements de modèles et en métriques de succès.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 PROFIL RECHERCHE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un profil justifiant a minima d’une première expérience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expérience :&lt;/strong&gt; Profil confirmé justifiant de plusieurs années d&#39;expérience professionnelle en entreprise (hors stages et alternances) en AI Engineering, ML Engineering ou Software Engineering orienté IA. Vous justifiez également d&#39;au moins une expérience concrète et réussie de mise en production d&#39;un système GenAI ou agentique.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stack Technique&lt;/strong&gt; : Solide maîtrise de Python, de l&#39;écosystème GCP / Vertex AI, et des frameworks d&#39;orchestration (LangChain, LlamaIndex ou ADK).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Expertise LLM &amp;amp; Agentique &lt;/strong&gt;: Solide maîtrise des architectures RAG (recherche vectorielle, Vertex AI Vector Search, gestion avancée de métadonnées), mais surtout des concepts techniques agentiques : function/tool-calling, boucles de raisonnement (ReAct, etc.), orchestration de workflows multi-agents, structured output et gestion du contexte/mémoire.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualité &amp;amp; Évaluation&lt;/strong&gt; : Capacité à diagnostiquer une réponse incorrecte (problème de modèle, de &lt;em&gt;retrieval&lt;/em&gt; ou de données) et appétence pour l&#39;observabilité applicative (SQL / BigQuery / MLflow).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langues &lt;/strong&gt;: Français courant obligatoire &amp;amp; anglais professionnel courant (environnement international).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les plus :&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance technique approfondie des protocoles A2A (Agent-to-Agent) et MCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expérience de traitement multimodal de documents ou dans des écosystèmes SIRH (ex: Workday).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compréhension technique des enjeux de sécurité (RBAC, ACLs, RGPD) appliqués aux LLMs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connaissance des architectures microservices et conception d&#39;APIs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🎁 CE QUE NOUS PROPOSONS&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;L&#39;opportunité de développer un produit d&#39;IA agentique de pointe avec un impact direct sur le quotidien de 100 000 collaborateurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un environnement technologique premium (Stack Google Cloud / Vertex AI / Databricks).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une politique de télétravail flexible (2 jours par semaine en remote, le reste dans nos bureaux à Paris - Canal de l’Ourcq).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une culture du &lt;em&gt;delivery&lt;/em&gt; axée sur l&#39;autonomie, l&#39;intelligence collective et la montée en compétences (accompagnement par un Lead, certifications, formations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Des avantages attractifs (primes mensuelles/trimestrielles, actionnariat salarié).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une ambiance résolument tournée vers le sport (nombreuses corpos, tests produits, pauses déjeuner sportives ou non, …)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DECATHLON DIGITAL&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imaginez si la technologie nous permettait de repousser les frontières et d&#39;offrir des expériences sportives inédites. C&#39;est précisément notre ambition chez Decathlon Digital ! Nous sommes une équipe de plus de 5 000 experts en ingénierie logicielle, gestion de produits, données, cloud et cybersécurité, répartis à Paris, Lille et Amsterdam. Ensemble, nous créons la plus vaste plateforme sportive numérique, en exploitant les innovations technologiques pour optimiser la chaîne de valeur, concevoir des expériences connectées et donner une seconde vie à nos produits.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Changeons la donne pour de bon.&lt;/strong&gt; Notre passion du sport nous guide et nous voulons qu’elle perdure. C’est pourquoi nous nous engageons à bâtir un modèle technologique plus durable, en réduisant notre impact direct sur l&#39;environnement, et en créant un espace sûr et inclusif pour apprendre et nous épanouir ensemble. Rejoins l’équipe et façonnons le futur du sport.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a> Data  Paris, Paris

Designer/ Art Director Healthcare (m/w/d) &lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Ogilvy &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy has been creating impact for brands through iconic, culture-changing, value-driving ideas since the company was founded by David Ogilvy more than 75 years ago. It builds on that rich legacy through Borderless Creativity—innovating at the intersection of intelligence, imagination and influence, with experts across advertising, sports &amp;amp; entertainment, PR &amp;amp; social, consulting, and health collaborating seamlessly across more than 120 offices spanning 90 countries. Ogilvy was named &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-brings-home-network-year-2026-cannes-lions-international-festival-creativity&quot;&gt;Network of the Year&lt;/a&gt; at the 2026 Cannes Lions International Festival of Creativity and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ogilvy.com/ideas/ogilvy-tops-warc-effective-100-creative-100-4th-straight-year&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;e2c78315-ff05-4544-925f-9288319dea2c&quot;&gt;ranks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;as the #1 global agency network for creative excellence and effectiveness by WARC for the fourth consecutive year, signifying its ability to deliver creative solutions that drive unreasonable impact for clients and communities. Ogilvy is part of WPP, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.ogilvy.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;39833259-880d-4fd8-930f-0d84b1c14850&quot;&gt;Ogilvy.com&lt;/a&gt;, and follow us on&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;735e393e-6e8a-4ca8-804a-74f1bd8166b6&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ogilvy&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;d10960ce-761b-48c5-81d5-0a7c4cc6013a&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;92ffcb70-6ca7-4d9a-88d5-c130e36e6c4f&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ogilvy/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;3bd2010d-00a2-401b-8cfb-7e8c24deac52&quot;&gt; Facebook.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;u&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://wpp.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;7f087527-f491-4cb6-a79d-3b4a67d1ec89&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/u&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ogilvy Health DACH ist eine grenzenlos agierende Kreativagentur, die durch nahtlose Zusammenarbeit über Disziplinen und Märkte hinweg Projekte realisiert – von lokalen Initiativen bis hin zu globalen Kampagnen. Unser Team arbeitet an der Schnittstelle von &lt;strong&gt;Healthcare, Social Media, Strategie, Experience und Influence&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Von Zürich aus betreuen wir das Healthcare-Portfolio von Ogilvy für die DACH-Region sowie ausgewählte internationale Kund:innen aus den Bereichen Pharma, Biotech und Medizintechnik. Unser interdisziplinäres Health-Team vereint Account Management, Medical Writing, PR, Digital, Strategie und Kreation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zum nächstmöglichen Zeitpunkt suchen wir eine:n&lt;strong&gt; Designer/ Art Director Health (m/w/d)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;in Berlin, Hamburg, Frankfurt/ Main, Düsseldorf oder Zürich.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;Das bieten wir:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Möglichkeit zur Arbeit im Mobile Office (bis zu 100%)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nutzung unseres&amp;nbsp;WPP Weiterbildungsnetzwerkes, inkl. LinkedIn Learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der privaten Altersvorsorge und die Gewährung von vermögenswirksamen Leistungen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jubiläumsprämien in Form von zusätzlichen Urlaubstagen&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Möglichkeit zur Nutzung eines Job Bikes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erweiterte Betriebliche Krankenversicherung mit einem zusätzlichen Budget von bis zu 300€ im Jahr&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zugriff auf unser&amp;nbsp;Employee&amp;nbsp;Assistance Programm&amp;nbsp;TELUS Health&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kostenlose Nutzung der&amp;nbsp;Headspace-App&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subventionierte&amp;nbsp;Gympass-Mitgliedschaft&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deine Aufgaben:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Art Director Health entwickelst und gestaltest du Kommunikationslösungen für renommierte Kund:innen aus dem Healthcare- und Pharmabereich. Dein Aufgabenspektrum reicht – je nach Projekt – von konkreten Kommunikationsmitteln wie Flyern, Broschüren, Präsentationen und Sales-Materialien bis hin zu visuellen Identitäten, digitalen Inhalten und integrierten Kampagnen.&lt;br&gt;Du entwickelst starke visuelle Konzepte, übersetzt medizinische und wissenschaftliche Inhalte in klare, relevante Kommunikation und begleitest Projekte von der ersten Idee bis zur finalen Umsetzung. Dabei arbeitest du eng mit Medical Writing, Client Services, Strategie, Creative Direction, Digital, PR, Production und externen Partner:innen zusammen.&lt;br&gt;Die Rolle erfordert kreative Exzellenz und ein gutes Verständnis für die besonderen Anforderungen der Healthcare-Kommunikation – insbesondere für Rx-Produkte, regulatorische Vorgaben und Review-Prozesse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Konzeption und Gestaltung von Kommunikationsmitteln für Print, Digital, Social Media und Bewegtbild – von Flyern, Broschüren und Präsentationen bis zu digitalen Assets und Kampagnenformaten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwicklung visueller Identitäten, Corporate Designs, Branding-Lösungen, Kampagnenwelten und visueller Narrative für Pharma-, Biotech- und Medtech-Kund:innen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Übersetzung medizinischer und wissenschaftlicher Inhalte in klare, zielgruppengerechte und visuell überzeugende Lösungen, insbesondere für Rx-, Disease-Awareness- und Patient-Engagement-Projekte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Präsentation und überzeugende Vermittlung von Ideen gegenüber Kund:innen sowie Begleitung der Umsetzung und Sicherstellung der gestalterischen Qualität über alle Kanäle und Formate hinweg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zusammenarbeit mit internen Fachbereichen und externen Partner:innen wie Fotograf:innen, Filmproduktionen, Freelancer:innen und Partneragenturen sowie Unterstützung bei Pitches, Neugeschäftsprojekten und der Weiterentwicklung bestehender Kund:innenbeziehungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Was du mitbringst:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abgeschlossene Ausbildung als Grafiker:in EFZ, Studium in Visueller Kommunikation, Grafikdesign oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation sowie mehrjährige Berufserfahrung als Art Director in einer Healthcare-, Pharma- oder Kommunikationsagentur&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fundierte Erfahrung in der Zusammenarbeit mit Kund:innen aus Pharma, Biotech und/oder Medtech sowie nachweisbare Erfahrung mit Kommunikationsmassnahmen für Rx-Produkte&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gutes Verständnis für medizinische Inhalte, regulatorische Anforderungen und Review-Prozesse in der Healthcare-Kommunikation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte konzeptionelle und gestalterische Fähigkeiten, ein überzeugendes Portfolio sowie sicherer Umgang mit der Adobe Creative Cloud und gängigen Design- und Präsentationstools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ausgeprägte Kommunikations- und Präsentationsfähigkeiten, ein sicheres Auftreten gegenüber Kund:innen sowie sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit Patient Engagement, PR- und Awareness-Kampagnen sowie Kenntnisse in Motion Design und Social/Digital Content Creation sind ein Plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verbindest kreative Exzellenz mit strategischem Denken und kannst komplexe Inhalte schnell erfassen und in relevante visuelle Ideen übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest proaktiv, selbständig, lösungsorientiert und zuverlässig – sowohl an grösseren Projekten als auch an konkreten Kommunikationsmitteln im Tagesgeschäft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kommunizierst klar, präsentierst sicher und kannst Kund:innen für deine Ideen begeistern. Die Zusammenarbeit in interdisziplinären und internationalen Teams macht dir Freude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Resilienz und Flexibilität für einen dynamischen und phasenweise intensiven Agenturalltag mit. Nicht alles ist planbar, Prioritäten und Timings können sich kurzfristig ändern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Auch bei hohem Tempo und mehreren parallelen Projekten bewahrst du den Überblick, hast einen hohen Qualitätsanspruch und übernimmst Verantwortung. In intensiven Phasen bist du bereit, gemeinsam mit dem Team die Extrameile zu gehen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir glauben an die Kraft von Diversität und Kollaboration. Den Herausforderungen der heutigen Welt können wir nur gemeinsam begegnen.&amp;nbsp;Wir verpflichten uns daher, für den Job in Frage kommende Bewerber:innen ausschließlich nach ihren Fähigkeiten und grundsätzlich unabhängig von Alter, Geschlecht, ethnischer Zugehörigkeit, sexueller Orientierung, Behinderung oder Religion zu beurteilen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Das klingt nach einer spannenden Herausforderung? Sehr gut, dein Ansprechpartner Kai Schlüter freut sich über deine Bewerbung!&lt;br&gt;Aus Gründen der Nachhaltigkeit und des Datenschutzes bitten wir darum, Bewerbungsunterlagen ausschließlich über unsere Bewerber:innenplattform Greenhouse an uns zu senden. Wir würden uns freuen, wenn auf das Mitsenden eines Fotos verzichtet würde.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Ogilvy, our people are at the heart of what we do: a creative agency that sparks game-changing ideas across culture and business through collaboration, integrity, and a celebration of self-expression.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in building powerful teams with purpose - and we relentlessly curate transformative initiatives that make our commitment to fairness, and equity a reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ultimate mission is to leave a positive impact on the world, creating a better future for all, while supporting and uplifting the global communities we serve.&amp;nbsp; This is central to our mantra of Borderless Creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ogilvy is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
