&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Lead and inspire:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; Create a high-performance environment where Account Managers are empowered, supported and challenged to deliver ambitious commercial goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
